# Components

## File Naming

- New UI component files should use PascalCase names, for example `MyComponent.tsx`.
- Helper modules inside component folders may use established support names such as `common.ts`, `types.ts`, `utils.ts`, `index.tsx`, or `keyboardNavHandlers.ts`.

## Changes Around New Components

- For behaviorful new components, add or update tests following the nearest local pattern instead of forcing a new global test style.
- Do not require Storybook for this repository; document public API or user-visible workflow changes in code comments or project docs only when they materially help future work.
- Follow neighboring export style rather than converting surrounding files between default and named exports.
